  <data name="welcome" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Welcome to GradeTracker!

This bot helps you track your grades, deadlines and GPA.
To get started, link your account with an invite code:
/bind &lt;code&gt;

Type /help to see available commands.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="help" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>GradeTracker - available commands:
/start - getting started
/help - this help
/bind &lt;code&gt; - link your account
/profile - your profile
/grades - view your grades by subject
/subjects - list subjects
/grade_add - add a grade
/grade_edit - edit a grade
/deadlines - your upcoming deadlines
/today - deadlines due today
/week - deadlines due this week
/next - your nearest deadline
/deadline_add - add a deadline
/deadline_edit - edit a deadline
/settings - notifications, quiet hours, time zone, language
/export - export your deadlines to a calendar (.ics)
/stats - your grade statistics
/cancel - cancel the current action

Admin only:
/admin - admin menu
/users - manage users and roles
/invites - manage invite codes
/audit - view the audit log
/status - system status
/announce &lt;message&gt; - broadcast to all users</value>
  </data>
